  (253, 1, '1 pound ground meat (turkey, beef, or pork)', '1 libra de carne molida (pavo, res, o puerco)'),
  (253, 2, '1 onion, peeled and cut into half-inch pieces', '1 cebolla, pelada y partida en pedazos de media pulgada'),
